{"ts": 1791255666.6068668, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice start. The quiz shows the main gap is still the core vocabulary, so let\u2019s tighten that up first.\n\nTry answering these two in one or two sentences each:\n1) What are the three parts of an environment?\n2) Why is attention described as a hidden variable?\n\nIf you want, I can then help you turn your answers into a build-ready checklist.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=20 messages 2m", "t": 22, "activity": [{"t": 20, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.37516055148468447, "pomdp": 0.35853496713560185, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8030104796182297, "motivation": 0.8330753570864192, "reliance": 0.34481971324228816, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
