{"ts": 1791255671.296843, "type": "step", "step": 26, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Great \u2014 you\u2019re close. The remaining step is to turn that understanding into something you can present on Friday.\n\nLet\u2019s do one more quick checkpoint: send me your draft environment definition as 4 bullets:\n- state\n- observations\n- actions\n- dynamics\n\nAfter that, I\u2019ll help you polish it and then we\u2019ll lock in the evaluation plan for 3 seeds and pass^k.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=30 messages 2m", "t": 32, "activity": [{"t": 30, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.37516055148468447, "pomdp": 0.5174929123823002, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 1.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7830104796182297, "motivation": 0.8330753570864192, "reliance": 0.3848197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
